Gods and seers plead Śiva against tormenting brothers --- Śiva declines killing and sends to Viṣṇu --- Gods plead Viṣṇu against Laṅkā fortress --- Viṣṇu knows Sukēśa sons and promises slaughter --- Mālyavān counsels brothers on Hari vow --- Brothers vaunt past god victories and mobilize --- Rākṣasa beast host abandons Laṅkā for heaven --- Brothers ignore dread bones blood quakes --- Viṣṇu praised by celestials meets foe --- Rākṣasas engulf Mādhava with bloody weapons